- Multiple environments (dev, test, prod)
- Dependency injection
- Flexible initialization

Pattern:
def create_app(config_name='development'):
    app = Flask(__name__)
    if config_name == 'development':
        app.config['DEBUG'] = True
    elif config_name == 'testing':
