## 📊 PARAMETER TUNING GUIDE

### Common Hyperparameter Ranges

```
Learning Rate (α):
- Start: 0.001
- Small datasets: 0.01-0.1
- Large datasets: 0.0001-0.001
- Too high: Divergence
- Too low: Slow convergence

Regularization (λ):
- Ridge/LASSO: 0.001 to 1000 (log scale)
- Small λ: Overfitting
- Large λ: Underfitting
- Use cross-validation

Number of Features (Tree Depth, SVM C, etc):
- Start simple (low complexity)
- Add complexity until overfitting
- Validate on test set
- Use cross-validation

Batch Size:
- Small datasets: 32-64
- Large datasets: 128-512
- GPU memory: Limit maximum

Number of Trees (Random Forest):
- Start: 100
- More usually better (until saturation)
- 100-1000 typical
- Diminishing returns after ~500
```

